'''Monk [[Tyrian armor]]''' is an art type introduced in the Prophecies campaign and is also available in the Factions campaign and Eye of the North expansion. This armor is called '''Monk''' armor up to maximum armor level in Droknar's Forge where it is instead called Tyrian armor.

'''Note''': Monk Tyrian armor does not have headgear, but the [[Monk Dragon armor|Dragon Scalp Design]] is available from the same armorer in Factions and Eye of the North. Pictures and crafting details are available on that page.

There is no [[prestige armor|prestige version]] of Tyrian armor.

